{"title":"People Photographed With Their Vehicles","link":"https://kottke.org/26/01/people-photographed-with-their-vehicles","date":1769613826000,"content":"\n         <img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1496\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1406\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1985\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1492\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1046\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48250-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1497\" />\n\nFor his project called Homo Mobilis, Martin Roemers travelled the globe and photographed people with their cars, bikes, scooters, etc. You can see a selection of the photos <a href=\"https://martinroemers.com/homo-mobilis/photos/\">on Roemers’ website</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/jan/10/martin-roemers-homo-mobilis-photography-book-car-vehicle-owners-portraits\">at The Guardian</a>, or in his forthcoming book, <a href=\"https://bookshop.org/a/2966/9789020992359\">Homo Mobilis</a> (<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/902099235X/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Amazon</a>). (via <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/steveportigal.bsky.social/post/3mcfryqn4ws23\">@steveportigal.bsky.social</a>) \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/cars\">cars</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Martin%20Roemers\">Martin Roemers</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/01/people-photographed-with-their-vehicles\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"db3d8faefafff13c331a3234266eb6a37a5a7905aef4d478075dc07f42fc900e","category":"Sites"}